{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Ben-A-[Eb]bi-na-dab served the [Abmaj7]king
In [Cm]charge of the [Bb]land of [Eb]Dor
He supplied provi[Eb/G]sions for the [Abmaj7]house
Where [Fm7]Solomon's word was [Bb]known
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Solomon's [Ab]daughter Tap[Bb]hath
Was his [Eb]wife, the text says
[Cm]A [Fm7]bond of flesh and spirit
[Bb]In the days of [Eb]old [Abmaj7]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Twelve officers o[Eb/G]versaw the [Abmaj7]land
[Cm]Each with their [Bb]own specific [Eb]charge
Ben-A-bi-na-dab held [Eb/G]his post [Abmaj7]
In [Fm7]the region near the [Bb]shore
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Solomon's [Ab]daughter Tap[Bb]hath
Was his [Eb]wife, the [Bb/D]text says
[Cm]A [Fm7]bond of flesh and spirit
[Bb]In the days of [Eb]old [Ebmaj7/D]
